OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 17 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,6,     GWales and conductor Jaime Martin
OL,7,     Gperform Greig, selections from
OL,8,     GTchaikovsky's Swan Lake, and
OL,9,     GNielsen's Flute Concerto with
OL,10,     Gsoloist Elizaveta Ivanova.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Accompanying Austen
OL,12,     GAntonia Quirke speaks to
OL,13,     Gcomposers who've scored original
OL,14,     Gmusic for Austen adaptations
OL,15,     Gabout their musical choices and
OL,16,     Galso about the music Austen
OL,17,     Gencountered. Today: Jeremy Sams.
